<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Simsmetal Q1 profit tumbles 34 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Simsmetal Q1 profit tumbles 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metals recycler Simsmetal Ltd said on Thursday net profit for the three months ended September 30, 1996 fell 34 percent to A$8.28 million.</p>
</text>
